{
  "meta": {
    "url": "https://strace.io",
    "description": [
      "跟踪系统调用和信号。"
    ]
  },
  "option": [
    {
      "name": "--abbrev",
      "usage": [
        "--abbrev <SET>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "缩写 SET 中系统调用的输出。",
        "SET 的语法与 --trace 相同。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "separator": ",",
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--absolute-timestamps",
      "alias": [
        "--timestamps"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "--absolute-timestamps[=<FORMAT>], --timestamps[=<FORMAT>]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "在每行前加上墙上时钟时间。",
        "FORMAT 为 none、time 或 unix；PRECISION 为 s、ms、us 或 ns。",
        "使用 format:VALUE 和 precision:VALUE，并用逗号连接。（默认 format:time,precision:s）",
        "值必须使用 '=' 附加。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "format:time"
        },
        {
          "name": "format:unix"
        },
        {
          "name": "none"
        },
        {
          "name": "precision:ms"
        },
        {
          "name": "precision:ns"
        },
        {
          "name": "precision:s"
        },
        {
          "name": "precision:us"
        },
        {
          "name": "time"
        },
        {
          "name": "time,ms"
        },
        {
          "name": "time,ns"
        },
        {
          "name": "time,s"
        },
        {
          "name": "time,us"
        },
        {
          "name": "unix"
        },
        {
          "name": "unix,ms"
        },
        {
          "name": "unix,ns"
        },
        {
          "name": "unix,s"
        },
        {
          "name": "unix,us"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--always-show-pid",
      "tip": [
        "也为 strace 启动的进程显示 PID 前缀。",
        "同时指定 -f 和 -o 时会隐式启用。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--arg-names",
      "alias": [
        "-N"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-N, --arg-names"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印系统调用参数名。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--argv0",
      "usage": [
        "--argv0 <NAME>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "将被跟踪命令的 argv[0] 设置为 NAME。"
      ],
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--attach",
      "alias": [
        "-p"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-p, --attach <PID>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "附加到进程 ID 为 PID 的进程。",
        "可重复使用；一个值可以列出多个 PID，用逗号、空格、制表符或换行分隔。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "separator": ",",
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--color",
      "usage": [
        "--color <WHEN>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "为输出着色。",
        "WHEN 为 auto、always 或 never。（默认 auto）"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "always"
        },
        {
          "name": "auto"
        },
        {
          "name": "never"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--columns",
      "alias": [
        "-a"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-a, --columns <COLUMN>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "设置打印系统调用结果的对齐列。（默认 40）"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "20"
        },
        {
          "name": "40"
        },
        {
          "name": "60"
        },
        {
          "name": "80"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--const-print-style",
      "alias": [
        "-X"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-X, --const-print-style <FORMAT>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "设置命名常量和标志的打印格式。（默认 abbrev）"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "abbrev"
        },
        {
          "name": "raw"
        },
        {
          "name": "verbose"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--daemonize",
      "usage": [
        "--daemonize[=<MODE>]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "将跟踪器作为被跟踪进程的孙进程运行。",
        "MODE 为 grandchild、pgroup、pgrp 或 session。（默认 grandchild）",
        "值必须使用 '=' 附加。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "grandchild"
        },
        {
          "name": "pgroup"
        },
        {
          "name": "pgrp"
        },
        {
          "name": "session"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--debug",
      "alias": [
        "-d"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-d, --debug"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "在标准错误上启用调试输出。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--decode-fds",
      "usage": [
        "--decode-fds[=<SET>]"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印 SET 中各类文件描述符的信息。",
        "SET 为逗号分隔的列表: path, socket, dev, eventfd, pidfd, signalfd。",
        "使用 all 或 none 表示整个集合。",
        "值必须使用 '=' 附加；单独使用该选项表示 path。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "separator": ",",
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "all"
        },
        {
          "name": "dev"
        },
        {
          "name": "eventfd"
        },
        {
          "name": "none"
        },
        {
          "name": "path"
        },
        {
          "name": "pidfd"
        },
        {
          "name": "signalfd"
        },
        {
          "name": "socket"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--decode-pids",
      "usage": [
        "--decode-pids <SET>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印与 PID 关联的附加信息。",
        "SET 为逗号分隔的 comm、pidns、all 或 none 列表。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "separator": ",",
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "all"
        },
        {
          "name": "comm"
        },
        {
          "name": "none"
        },
        {
          "name": "pidns"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--detach-on",
      "alias": [
        "-b"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-b, --detach-on <SYSCALL>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "到达 SYSCALL 时与被跟踪进程分离。",
        "目前仅支持 execve。"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "execve"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--env",
      "alias": [
        "-E"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-E, --env <VAR[=VAL]>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "在被跟踪命令的环境中设置 VAR=VAL。",
        "仅使用 VAR 可从环境中移除该变量。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "next": []
    },
    {
      "name": "--failed-only",
      "alias": [
        "-Z"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-Z, --failed-only"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "仅打印返回错误的系统调用。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--fault",
      "usage": [
        "--fault <SET[:ACTION]...>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "向 SET 中的系统调用注入故障。",
        "SET 的语法与 --trace 相同。",
        "这是 --inject 的快捷方式，默认错误为 ENOSYS。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "openat"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:error=EACCES"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:error=ENOENT"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:when=1+"
        },
        {
          "name": "read:error=EIO"
        },
        {
          "name": "read:when=1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--follow-forks",
      "alias": [
        "-f"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-f, --follow-forks"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "跟随由 fork、vfork 和 clone 创建的子进程。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--help",
      "alias": [
        "-h"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-h, --help"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印帮助摘要。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--inject",
      "usage": [
        "--inject <SET[:ACTION]...>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "对 SET 中的系统调用执行篡改。",
        "SET 的语法与 --trace 相同。",
        "动作: error=ERRNO、retval=VALUE、signal=SIG、syscall=SYSCALL、delay_enter=DELAY、delay_exit=DELAY、poke_enter=@argN=DATA、poke_exit=@argN=DATA、when=FIRST[..LAST][+[STEP]]。"
      ],
      "repeat": 99,
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "chdir:error=ENOENT:when=3+"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:delay_enter=100ms"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:delay_exit=100ms"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:error=ENOENT"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:error=ENOENT:when=1..5"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:poke_enter=@arg1=0000DEAD0000BEEF"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:poke_exit=@arg1=0000DEAD0000BEEF"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:retval=0"
        },
        {
          "name": "openat:signal=SIGSEGV"
        },
        {
          "name": "read:error=EIO:when=1"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--instruction-pointer",
      "alias": [
        "-i"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-i, --instruction-pointer"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "打印系统调用时的指令指针。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--interruptible",
      "alias": [
        "-I"
      ],
      "usage": [
        "-I, --interruptible <MODE>"
      ],
      "tip": [
        "控制 strace 何时可被信号中断。",
        "MODE 为 1/anywhere、2/waiting、3/never 或 4/never_tstp。"
      ],
      "next": [
        {
          "name": "1"
        },
        {
          "name": "2"
        },
        {
          "name": "3"
        },
        {
          "name": "4"
        },
        {
          "name": "anywhere"
        },
        {
          "name": "never"
        },
        {
          "name": "never_tstp"
        },
        {
          "name": "waiting"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--kill-on-exit",
      "tip": [
        "跟踪器退出时杀死所有被跟踪进程。",
        "与 -p/--attach 不兼容。"
      ]
    },
    {
      "name": "--kvm",
      "usage": [
        "--kvm <VCPU[+]>"
